cool AI stuff to talk about today. Let's dive in. So imagine you asked a super creative friend to

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:22.100
design the look of your new video game. Every single time you ask them, they picked completely different

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:27.920
colors, fonts, and button styles with no consistency at all. That is basically what has been happening

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:34.360
when people use AI coding helpers to build screens or app layouts. The AI basically guesses the

00:00:34.360 --> 00:00:39.280
whole visual style from scratch every time with nothing to guide it. A smart developer noticed

