00:02:20.320 --> 00:02:25.080
Okay, now for my favorite part of the show where we go under the hood. Let's talk about how AI chat

00:02:25.080 --> 00:02:29.620
bots actually think when they answer you. You know how when you are texting a friend and your phone

00:02:29.620 --> 00:02:35.320
suggests the next word. That is basically what a language model is doing but on steroids. Imagine

00:02:35.320 --> 00:02:42.260
the world's biggest what comes next game. The AI has read millions of books, websites, conversations

00:02:42.260 --> 00:02:47.860
and scripts. It does not actually understand things the way a human does. Instead, it has learned

00:02:47.860 --> 00:02:53.620
patterns like after seeing the words once upon a it knows time is extremely likely to come next.

00:02:54.080 --> 00:02:59.320
After the sky is it knows blue is a very common follow up. Every single time you type something,

00:02:59.620 --> 00:03:05.380
the AI turns your words into a giant list of numbers called tokens, which are roughly one token per word

00:03:05.380 --> 00:03:11.700
or small piece of a word. It then plays that giant what comes next game hundreds of times predicting

00:03:11.700 --> 00:03:16.860
one word after another until it has a full answer. It is not searching the internet for your exact

00:03:16.860 --> 00:03:22.040
question. It is remembering patterns from everything it was trained on and guessing the most sensible

00:03:22.040 --> 00:03:27.640
continuation. That is why sometimes it makes stuff up because it is just really good at sounding

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:33.600
confident while playing the prediction game. And that is also why giving it a design.md file works so

00:03:33.600 --> 00:03:39.020
well. You are adding new very specific patterns right at the start of the game so the AI guesses

00:03:39.020 --> 00:03:44.640
stay on brand instead of wandering off. So next time you hear someone say large language model,

00:03:45.060 --> 00:03:49.740
you can tell them it is basically the world's most advanced autocomplete that got so good it can

00:03:49.740 --> 00:03:54.740
write essays code and answer questions. Not magic, just really impressive pattern prediction,

